Think of it like this:
```js
const p = new Promise((resolve) => {
  console.log("I run RIGHT NOW");      // sync — happens immediately
  resolve("done");                      // queues "done" for .then()
  console.log("I also run RIGHT NOW"); // sync — happens immediately
